    "Ask": {
      "title": "Apply “Like Garuda Linux (Dr460nized)”?",
      "text": "The look <b>Like Garuda Linux (Dr460nized)</b> will be applied to your desktop.<br><br>What will change: global theme, colours, window frames, desktop shell theme, Qt application style, GTK theme, icons, cursors, fonts, wallpaper, panel layout, desktop behaviour.<br><br>Rexon will install the programs it needs: kvantum, beautyline, ttf-fira-sans, ttf-firacode-nerd, plasma-applet-window-buttons, kdeplasma-addons. Your system will ask for your password.<br><br>Rexon does not build AUR packages by itself. If you want the missing parts, install them yourself and apply the look again: aur/plasma6-wallpapers-blurredwallpaper aur/plasma6-applets-panel-colorizer aur/plasma6-applets-window-title<br><br>You can put everything back at any time with the “Put Back as It Was” button.",
      "yes_text": "Apply",
      "no_text": "Cancel",
      "choices": [],
      "option": null
    }
